+# Gate: budget
+
+*`budget` · founder essay 2026-09-14, the Reasoning Gateway ("Test-Time Compute Budgeting... Budget exhaustion -> forced termination -- the agent stops thinking and executes the best-so-far plan when the budget runs out") · planes: ci*
+
+A reasoning run is halted the instant one of three ceilings trips -- a repeated (tool, target) pair proving zero new evidence, a running sum of declared cost_usd crossing --max-cost-usd, or the existing per-goal branch budget (bin/idp-trajectory's budget_per_goal) -- and the best-so-far plan (goal, subgoal completion, steps and dollars spent) is surfaced instead of a claim the run finished
+
+This page is generated by `bin/idp-gate-demo` from `rules.yaml`. The output below is what the gate itself printed when the generator ran it; it is not a description of what the gate does.
+
+## Run it yourself
+
+```bash
+python3 bin/idp-budget
+```
+
+## Refused
+
+Fixture: `--run tests/fixtures/budget/exhausted/session.jsonl`
+
+Exit code `1` (the registry expects non-zero). ✓
+
+```
+      best-so-far: goal=investigate latency spike subgoals=[sg1] steps=5/5 cost=$0.00/$0.50
+FAIL  budget halted at step 7 (branch_budget): budget exhausted for sg1 (5/5). You are spinning. Execute revise_plan, or escalate to a human.
+```
+
+## Permitted
+
+Fixture: `--run tests/fixtures/budget/complete/session.jsonl`
+
+Exit code `0` (the registry expects zero). ✓
+
+```
+ok    budget plan complete inside budget
+       goal=restart the stalled worker subgoals=[sg1*] steps=3/5 cost=$0.00/$0.50
+```
+
+## The registry's own lines
+
+- when it passes: a run stays inside its declared step and cost ceilings, or finishes its plan before either is reached
+- when it refuses: a run crossed a ceiling and was not stopped -- the unbounded-loop case the founder's essay names. Deterministic: reuses bin/idp-trajectory's own budget_per_goal/authorize() for the branch ceiling and bin/idp-epistemic's target-normalisation for the information-gain ceiling, imported rather than re-implemented (R43); the cost ceiling sums only a step's own declared cost_usd, never a fabricated number.
+
+Origin: docs/tickets/2026-09-14-reasoning-gateway.md, deliverable D2
